# review-pr

Apply the review-pr skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- produce review pr artifact
- validate review pr completion criteria
- trace review pr decisions across inputs, constraints, and failure paths
- validate delivery outcomes with evidence, assumptions, and explicit next steps

Stop when: Review a pull request against the fixed point the user supplies, separating Standards and Spec findings into distinct ax complete; structured result returned; completion criteria checked.
